    <aside class="usage-panel" aria-labelledby="installation-heading">
      <p class="eyebrow">Installation</p>
      <h2 id="installation-heading">Wire it inline.</h2>
      <ol class="usage-list">
        <li>Disconnect power from the project.</li>
        <li>Connect the DC source to the marked IN terminals.</li>
        <li>Connect the protected project to the marked OUT terminals.</li>
        <li>Restore power and confirm the status LED.</li>
      </ol>
      <p class="spec-note">DevGuard 24 is a protection module, not a voltage regulator or isolated converter. Select the fuse version appropriate for the expected load.</p>
